<div class="pp-html" style="padding:56px 0;background:#ffffff">
  <div class="page-width">
<div class="pp-rb">
  <h2 class="pp-rb__title"><span>Made for real eyes.</span> Not just the ones in ads.</h2>
  <p class="pp-rb__sub">Hooded, watery, mature, sparse — whatever your lids are doing, there is a way to line
    them. Tap a card for how.</p>
  <div class="pp-rb__grid">
    <article class="pp-rb__card">
      <div class="pp-rb__inner">
        <div class="pp-rb__face pp-rb__face--front">
          <img src="{{ product.images[1] | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80">
          <div class="pp-rb__txt"><h3>Hooded Eyes</h3><p>Lines that still show when your eyes are open.</p></div>
          <button type="button" class="pp-rb__btn" aria-label="How it works for hooded eyes">+</button>
        </div>
        <div class="pp-rb__face pp-rb__face--back">
          <h3>Hooded Eyes</h3>
          <p>Draw the line slightly above your natural lash line and keep it thin at the inner corner, thicker
            through the outer third. When the lid drops, that is the part still on show. The matte finish helps
            too: shimmer catches light in the fold and draws the eye straight to it.</p>
          <button type="button" class="pp-rb__btn pp-rb__btn--close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="pp-rb__card">
      <div class="pp-rb__inner">
        <div class="pp-rb__face pp-rb__face--front">
          <img src="{{ product.images[2] | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80">
          <div class="pp-rb__txt"><h3>Mature Eyes</h3><p>Definition that does not sit in fine lines.</p></div>
          <button type="button" class="pp-rb__btn" aria-label="How it works for mature eyes">+</button>
        </div>
        <div class="pp-rb__face pp-rb__face--back">
          <h3>Mature Eyes</h3>
          <p>Skip the solid band. Short feathered strokes pressed into the lash roots read softer and do not
            emphasise texture. A matte formula matters here — glitter and satin finishes reflect light off every
            crease. Chocolate, Bronze and Stone are gentler than a hard black.</p>
          <button type="button" class="pp-rb__btn pp-rb__btn--close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="pp-rb__card">
      <div class="pp-rb__inner">
        <div class="pp-rb__face pp-rb__face--front">
          <img src="{{ product.images[3] | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80">
          <div class="pp-rb__txt"><h3>Watery Eyes</h3><p>Holds when your eyes will not behave.</p></div>
          <button type="button" class="pp-rb__btn" aria-label="How it works for watery eyes">+</button>
        </div>
        <div class="pp-rb__face pp-rb__face--back">
          <h3>Watery Eyes</h3>
          <p>Give it twenty seconds to set before you blink hard — that is when the waterproof finish locks.
            Tightline along the upper lash line rather than the lower waterline, which floods first. Blot once
            with a tissue, do not rub.</p>
          <button type="button" class="pp-rb__btn pp-rb__btn--close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="pp-rb__card">
      <div class="pp-rb__inner">
        <div class="pp-rb__face pp-rb__face--front">
          <img src="{{ product.images[4] | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80">
          <div class="pp-rb__txt"><h3>Sparse Brows</h3><p>Fills gaps without the drawn-on look.</p></div>
          <button type="button" class="pp-rb__btn" aria-label="How it works for sparse brows">+</button>
        </div>
        <div class="pp-rb__face pp-rb__face--back">
          <h3>Sparse Brows</h3>
          <p>Flick short strokes in the direction the hair grows, then brush through so nothing reads as a line.
            Match undertone, not depth: Chocolate and Bronze for warm or red hair, Graphite and Stone for cool,
            ashy or greying brows.</p>
          <button type="button" class="pp-rb__btn pp-rb__btn--close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

